	"Description": "[size=5]Based on the original Combine ring, this mod introduces a new class that allows trinkets to be combined as well!\n<br />Features:\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Built-in support for multi-level stacking and combining identical items.\n<br />[*]Fully configurable via the config file.\n<br />[*]Compatible with GenericModConfigMenu for easy in-game settings adjustment.\n<br />[/list]Known Issue:\n<br />After loading a saved game, visual summons (e.g., spirits summoned by trinkets) may disappear, but their effects remain active. To restore the visual appearance, simply re-equip the trinket.[/size]",
